{"seq":3,"slug":"bioprocess-equipment","title":"生物制造工艺与装备","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/biomanufacturing/bioprocess-equipment","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"bioreactor-dynamics","title":"生物反应器动力学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/biomanufacturing/bioprocess-equipment/bioreactor-dynamics","wordCount":1414,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"bioseparation-engineering","title":"生物分离工程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/biomanufacturing/bioprocess-equipment/bioseparation-engineering","wordCount":1593,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"intelligent-bioprocess-control","title":"智能生物过程控制","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/biomanufacturing/bioprocess-equipment/intelligent-bioprocess-control","wordCount":1698,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"生物制造工艺与装备-简介\">生物制造工艺与装备 简介</h1><p>将实验室中验证的菌株与生物催化体系转化为工业级生产能力，是生物制造产业化的核心挑战。本章从反应器工程、下游分离到智能过程控制三个维度，系统讲解从毫升级摇瓶到万吨级生产的工程放大逻辑与关键技术。</p>\n<p><strong>生物反应器动力学</strong>围绕微生物生长与产物形成动力学模型（Monod方程、Logistic模型），讲解搅拌式反应器的设计原则与放大准则（等<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_La</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span>、等<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P/V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span>），气升式与固定床反应器的适用场景，以及溶氧（OUR）、体积氧传质系数（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_La</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span>）等关键过程参数的在线监测方法。</p>\n<p><strong>生物分离工程</strong>覆盖从细胞破碎、固液分离到精制纯化的全流程：离子交换色谱、亲和色谱、高效液相色谱（HPLC）的原理与选型，膜分离技术（超滤/纳滤）的应用，以及分离过程集成设计如何降低总成本并提升收率。</p>\n<p><strong>智能生物过程控制</strong>介绍过程分析技术（PAT）框架下的实时传感与数据采集，数字孪生技术如何建立物理过程的虚拟镜像用于预测与优化，AI辅助发酵参数调优的最新实践，以及连续制造模式相对于传统批次操作的经济性与质量优势。</p>\n<p>学习建议：本章知识与化工原理、控制理论密切关联，建议结合BioProcess模拟软件（如SuperPro Designer）进行工艺设计练习，同时参观或实习于发酵企业以建立工程尺度感。</p>\n"}